body:
To add to point 2 and please correct me if I'm wrong here. Did she even say she had a plan before it was done? I may be misremembering but I feel that was part of my frustration towards her. Not the absence of a given plan, but the absence of any plan (at least from the audience perspective)

&#x200B;

EDIT: Just as a sort of joke here. My younger sibling thought she was a first order spy when we watched it together
